WEBVTT

00:39.485 --> 00:40.566
I'm

00:42.528 --> 00:49.836
not in bed. I'm at the rehab center clearing my

00:49.856 --> 00:54.878
head. They brought me here to Blacksburg to

00:54.918 --> 01:01.003
start the fight again. I'm hooked up to a monitor

01:01.243 --> 01:07.587
to watch the pain. The nurses watch me as I move.

01:08.008 --> 01:13.111
I'm walking on the track. My chest is tight, my

01:13.151 --> 01:18.075
