01:18.135 --> 01:24.539
first day of the rest of my new life. I'm pushing

01:24.599 --> 01:31.403
past the limit. I'm ready to begin. This is the

01:31.483 --> 01:37.687
breaking point. I'm in the recovery zone. I'm

01:37.727 --> 01:43.732
going all the way. I'm not afraid to stand alone.

01:44.072 --> 01:51.398
I'm one in a million. I'm never giving in. This is

01:51.438 --> 01:55.301
the fight. And I'm gonna win.

01:58.944 --> 02:03.788
My sternum's held by wires. I move so slow and

02:03.888 --> 02:09.243
