02:33.007 --> 02:37.008
I'm pushing past the limit I'm ready to begin

02:37.488 --> 02:41.394
This is the breaking point I'm in the red

02:41.434 --> 02:47.217
concrete zone. I'm going all the way. I'm not

02:47.237 --> 02:54.142
afraid to stand alone. I'm one in a million. I'm

02:54.162 --> 03:01.286
never giving in. This is the fight. And I'm going

03:01.306 --> 03:10.778
to win. No more running No more hiding I'm

03:10.818 --> 03:18.341
finally deciding To be the hero of my own story

03:54.609 --> 04:11.013
This

04:11.133 --> 04:16.115
is the breaking point I'm in the recovery zone

04:17.620 --> 04:22.923
I'm going all the way. I'm not afraid to stand

04:23.063 --> 04:29.687
